<title>HONG KONG: SHK Properties 1995/96 net up 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>SHK Properties 1995/96 net up 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   469.0  vs 446.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    126.0  vs 117.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    11,039 vs 10,363</p>
<p>    Turnover		     22,619 vs 19,845</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 8-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Sun Hung Kai Properties is a property investment and development company.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special cash bonus of 38 H.K. cents per share vs same.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 224 cents (including interim dividend of 60 cents and special cash bonus of 38 cents) vs 213 cents (including interim dividend and special cash bonus).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
